-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Google Identity Services (loaded on demand from accounts.google.com)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://developers.google.com/identity

The Google Identity Services library is provided by Google and is subject to
Google's terms of service (https://policies.google.com/terms). It is loaded
on demand when the user signs in to enable the optional Google Drive backup
feature. No Google source code is bundled with this app.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OpenStreetMap (map tiles for the session-location feature)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

The session-location feature embeds an OpenStreetMap iframe that displays
map tiles loaded from www.openstreetmap.org. Map data is © OpenStreetMap
contributors and is available under the Open Database License (ODbL):
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/. No OpenStreetMap source is
bundled with this app.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dropbox API (optional backup destination)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://www.dropbox.com/developers

The optional Dropbox backup feature calls the Dropbox API directly from the
browser (api.dropboxapi.com / content.dropboxapi.com). No Dropbox source code
is bundled with this app; usage is subject to Dropbox's terms of service
(https://www.dropbox.com/terms).

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Webfonts (redistributed under public/fonts/)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The app self-hosts three typefaces instead of loading them from a font CDN.
The .woff2 files are REDISTRIBUTED as part of this repository and of every
deployed build, so their notices travel with them, as SIL OFL 1.1 section 2
requires. Full licence text: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

  DM Sans (public/fonts/dm-sans-var.woff2)
    Copyright 2014 The DM Sans Project Authors
    https://github.com/googlefonts/dm-fonts
    Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

  Newsreader (public/fonts/newsreader-var.woff2,
              public/fonts/newsreader-italic-var.woff2)
    Copyright 2020 The Newsreader Project Authors
    http://github.com/productiontype/Newsreader
    Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

  IBM Plex Mono (public/fonts/ibm-plex-mono-{400,500,600,700}.woff2)
    Copyright 2017 IBM Corp. All rights reserved.
    https://github.com/IBM/plex
    Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

